  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e4b5683c1ea36345958694d590b6436, type: 3}
  m_Name: COC3_Quiz_LO3_Testing_Q08
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: A ping to the server succeeds but the share will not open. What does
    that tell you?
  choices:
  - The server is switched off
  - The cable is faulty
  - The client has no IP address
  - The network is fine, so the fault is in sharing, permissions or name resolution
  correctChoiceIndex: 3
  points: 10
  explanation: Ping proves the two machines can reach each other. Everything above
    that layer is still in question, which is exactly why the tests are ordered this
    way.
